{
  "title": "查看器工具栏",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>查看器工具栏</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt;\">条目拆离窗口中的侧边栏包含文件查看器选项卡的控件。有关更多信息，请参阅<a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">侧边栏及其属性</a>。</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">通过查看器工具栏控件，可使用以下工具栏：</p>\n  <ul style=\"list-style: disc;\">\n    <li>\n      <p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><a href=\"#PDF_Viewer_Toolbar\">PDF 查看器工具栏</a></p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><a href=\"#Image_viewer_Toolbar\">图像查看器工具栏</a></p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><a href=\"#3D_Viewer_Toolbar\">3D 查看器工具栏</a></p>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n  <h2><a id=\"PDF_Viewer_Toolbar\" name=\"PDF_Viewer_Toolbar\"></a>PDF 查看器工具栏</h2>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">PDF 查看器基本工具栏如下所示：</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/basictoolbar.jpg\"></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">PDF 查看器高级工具栏如下所示：</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/advancedtoolbar.jpg\"></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">可用命令如下：</p>\n  \n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 64px; margin-left: 0px;\" width=\"831\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width: 13.858%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 18.655%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 67.488%;\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"t1st\" style=\"height: 59px;\">\n        <td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\" style=\"text-indent: 0px; text-align: center;\">图标</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\">提示</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\">说明</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/viewicon.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">查看</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">显示 PDF 文件。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/markup.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">标注</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text_align: center;\">允许您对文件进行标注批注。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/highlight.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">高亮</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text_align: center;\">允许您高亮文件中的部分内容。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/locate.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">标签</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">允许您为文件中的文本或图形添加标签。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/select.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">选择</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">允许您选择文件中的项目。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/delete.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">删除</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">删除所选项目。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/download.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">下载</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">下载文件。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/print.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">打印</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">打印文件。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/basic.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"Test-align: center;\">切换到基本工具栏</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">切换到基本工具栏。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/standardtool.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">切换到标准工具栏</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">切换到标准工具栏</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image561.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">放大</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">放大视图</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image562.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">缩小</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">缩小视图</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/resetview.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">重置视图</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">恢复到之前的视图</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/orient2.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">朝向面</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">显示 CAD 模型朝向您的方向，展示所选零件的表面。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/setdisplay.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">设置显示样式</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">选择条目的显示样式。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/measure.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">测量</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">指定要使用的测量方法。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/explodeview.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">爆炸视图</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">允许您将图纸拆解以查看各个组件。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/crosection.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">截面</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">允许您创建和查看图纸的截面。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/modelbrowser.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">模型浏览器</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">允许您从不同角度查看模型。有两种视图类型：标准和 CAD。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/prodman.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">产品制造信息</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">选择此图标以查看关联的产品信息。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/configuration.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">配置</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">显示 CAD 模型的可用查看配置列表。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/aras-images/image563.gif\" style=\"border: none;\" width=\"27\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">适合宽度</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">在水平方向上将页面宽度适配到查看器框架。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image564.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">适合高度</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">在垂直方向上将页面高度适配到查看器框架。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image565.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">上一页</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">跳转到上一页（如果当前为第一页则无效果）</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image566.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">下一页</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">跳转到当前页之后的下一页（如果当前为最后一页则无效果）</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image567.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">转到页面</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">打开<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">分页</span>对话框：</p>\n          <p class=\"Content_body\">   <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/Paging.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">   显示当前页码。</p>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">   输入目标页码并按回车键即可显示该页。</p>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">   点击上下箭头图标分别跳转到第一页和最后一页。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image568.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">查找</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">打开<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">查找</span>对话框：</p>\n          <p class=\"Content_body\">   <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/Find.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">   输入要搜索的文本并按回车键即可定位文本。</p>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">   点击右箭头可将文件定位到该文本字符串的下一个匹配位置。</p>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">   点击左箭头可在文件中向后搜索。</p>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">   如果勾选<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">全部高亮</span>复选框，所有匹配的文本将立即高亮显示。</p>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">   如果勾选<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">区分大小写</span>复选框，文本搜索将区分大小写。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image569.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">缩放百分比</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">打开<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">缩放</span>对话框：</p>\n          <p class=\"Content_body\">   <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/Zoom_Percentage.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">   缩放值默认设置为 100%。</p>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">   输入目标百分比即可将页面缩放到该比例。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image570.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">顺时针旋转 90 度</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">将文件内容顺时针旋转 90 度</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image573.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">逆时针旋转 90 度</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">将文件内容逆时针旋转 90 度</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image578.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">打开高级工具栏</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">打开高级工具栏。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 31px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image574.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">关闭高级工具栏</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">关闭高级工具栏。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  \n  <h2><a id=\"Image_viewer_Toolbar\" name=\"Image_viewer_Toolbar\"></a>图像查看器工具栏</h2>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">图像查看器基本工具栏如下所示：</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/basictoolbar.jpg\"></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">图像查看器高级工具栏如下所示：</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/imagevieweradvanced.jpg\"></p>\n  <h2><a name=\"3D_Viewer_Toolbar\"></a>3D 查看器工具栏</h2>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">3D 查看器基本工具栏如下所示：</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/3d_basic.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">3D 查看器高级工具栏如下所示：</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/3d_advanced.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">可用命令如下：</p>\n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 64px; margin-left: 0px;\" width=\"976\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width: 12.905%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 13.886%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 73.21%;\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"t1st\" style=\"height: 59px;\">\n        <td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\" style=\"text-indent: 0px; text-align: center;\">图标</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\">提示</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\">说明</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image561.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">放大</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">放大视图</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image562.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">缩小</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">缩小视图</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image581.gif\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">重置视图</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">将视图恢复为默认状态。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 454px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image177.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">设置视图方向</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">打开<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">视图方向选择器：</span></p>\n          <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Table\" width=\"96.322%\">\n            <colgroup>\n              <col style=\"width: 13.766%;\">\n              <col style=\"width: 17.775%;\">\n              <col style=\"width: 68.458%;\">\n            </colgroup>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr class=\"t1st\" style=\"height: 57px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_header\">图标</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_header\">提示</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_header\">说明</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n                <td rowspan=\"8\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">  <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"326\" src=\"/aras-images/image198.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></span></td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">等轴测视图</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">将视图设置为等轴测视图。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">朝向面</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">用户需选择一个平面，视图将垂直于该平面方向定向。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">左视图</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">将视图设置为左视图。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">右视图</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">将视图设置为右视图。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">底视图</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">将视图设置为底视图。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">前视图</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">将视图设置为前视图。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">后视图</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">将视图设置为后视图。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">顶视图</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">将视图设置为顶视图。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 298px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image178.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"text-align: center;\">设置显示样式</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">打开<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">显示样式选择器：</span></p>\n          <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Table\" width=\"66.601%\">\n            <colgroup>\n              <col style=\"width: 15.807%;\">\n              <col style=\"width: 36.477%;\">\n              <col style=\"width: 47.717%;\">\n            </colgroup>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr class=\"t1st\" style=\"height: 57px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_header\">图标</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_header\">提示</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_header\">说明</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 49px;\">\n                <td rowspan=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">  </span><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image199.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">线框</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">以线框模式显示。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 49px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">隐藏线</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">以隐藏线模式显示。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 49px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">着色</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">以着色模式显示。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">着色上叠加线框</p>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"Table_Body\">以着色上叠加线框模式显示。</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"height: 432px;\">\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/image179.jpg\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n        </td>\n  